            "heading": "",
            "text": "Government science jobs after a BSc are mostly technical, scientific assistant and laboratory posts in space, defence and research bodies and public institutes, and they are reached through official notifications, written tests and interviews with strict eligibility rules."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Watch official recruitment notices, check which posts accept a BSc, prepare for the written test and keep a skill-based backup."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Use only the official recruitment website and verify every notice."
          }
        ]
      },
